  "description": "Four independent two-byte FILE STATUS areas - app/cbl/CBSTM03B.CBL:83-97, gate G47. One 01 group per SELECT, so a failure on one file cannot perturb another's status, and nothing in the program shares a status between paragraphs. All four files are opened, then CUSTFILE alone is closed and read by key while closed, which reports '47'. The three reads that follow - sequential on TRNXFILE, sequential on XREFFILE, keyed on ACCTFILE - each report '00', and a final keyed read of the still-closed CUSTFILE reports '47' again. Ten calls in one ordered transcript, so the independence is visible as an interleaving rather than asserted in the abstract.",
